cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Cite the original Science study when using these data. The preferred citation
  below is for that study, not for the downloader. The top-level software record
  identifies this independent downloader separately.
title: Dumortier 2019 dataset downloader
type: software
version: 0.2.0
authors:
  - family-names: Strawbridge
    given-names: Stanley E.
repository-code: https://github.com/stanleystrawbridge/dumortier-2019-downloader
url: https://github.com/stanleystrawbridge/dumortier-2019-downloader
license: GPL-3.0-only
abstract: >-
  Independent single-script downloader for publicly linked imaging and associated
  data accompanying Dumortier et al. (Science, 2019), hosted by Institut Curie.
  Supports user-selected destinations, cached inventories and resumable transfers.
keywords:
  - mouse embryo
  - blastocyst
  - microscopy
  - research data
  - downloader
preferred-citation:
  type: article
  authors:
    - family-names: Dumortier
      given-names: Julien G.
    - family-names: Le Verge-Serandour
      given-names: Mathieu
    - family-names: Tortorelli
      given-names: Anna Francesca
    - family-names: Mielke
      given-names: Annette
    - family-names: de Plater
      given-names: Ludmilla
    - family-names: Turlier
      given-names: Hervé
    - family-names: Maître
      given-names: Jean-Léon
  title: Hydraulic fracturing and active coarsening position the lumen of the mouse blastocyst
  journal: Science
  volume: '365'
  issue: '6452'
  start: '465'
  end: '468'
  year: 2019
  month: 8
  doi: 10.1126/science.aaw7709
  url: https://www.science.org/doi/10.1126/science.aaw7709
